state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,20,68,72,74,57],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"14050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,20,68,72,74,57],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"14050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,20,68,72,74,57],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"12900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10005","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,20,68,72,74,57],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"12900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"出身于魏晋时期的顶级门阀——河东卫氏。曹魏重臣卫觊之子，西晋司徒、著名书法家卫瓘之弟。卫寔凭借家族的巨大影响力踏入仕途，官至散骑常侍，并被封为开阳乡（亭）侯。还曾任弘农太守。卫瓘获封菑阳侯时，曾分出部分爵位给弟弟卫寔，使其获封开阳亭侯。女儿卫琇，后来嫁给了西晋重臣王浚为继室。","tc":"出身于魏晉時期的頂級門閥——河東衛氏。曹魏重臣衛覬之子，西晉司徒、著名書法家衛瓘之弟。衛寔憑借家族的巨大影響力踏入仕途，官至散騎常侍，并被封為開陽鄉（亭）侯。還曾任弘農太守。衛瓘獲封菑陽侯時，曾分出部分爵位給弟弟衛寔，使其獲封開陽亭侯。女兒衛琇，后來嫁給了西晉重臣王浚為繼室。","en":"Hailed from the Hedong Wei clan—one of the premier noble houses of the Wei and Jin dynasties. He was the son of Wei Ji, an important minister of Cao Wei, and the younger brother of Wei Guan, the Senior Minister and renowned calligrapher of the Western Jin. Relying on his family's vast influence, Wei Shi entered officialdom, rising to Cavalier Attendant-in-Ordinary and being enfeoffed as the District (Village) Marquis of Kaiyang. He also served as the Governor of Hongnong. When Wei Guan was enfeoffed as the Marquis of Ziyang, he transferred part of his noble title to his younger brother Wei Shi, enabling him to be enfeoffed as the Village Marquis of Kaiyang. His daughter, Wei Xiu, later married the prominent Western Jin minister Wang Jun as his second wife.","jp":"魏晋期屈指の門閥である河東衛氏の出身。曹魏の重臣・衛覬の子で、西晋の司徒であり高名な書家でもあった衛瓘の弟。衛寔は家族の絶大な影響力を背景に官途に就き、官位は散騎常侍に至り、開陽郷（亭）侯に封じられた。また弘農太守も務めた。衛瓘が菑陽侯に封じられた際、その爵位の一部を弟の衛寔に分け与え、開陽亭侯に封じさせている。娘の衛琇は、のちに西晋の重臣・王浚の継室として嫁いだ。","kr":"위진 시대 최고의 명문 세족인 하동 위씨 가문 출신입니다. 조위의 중신 위기의 아들이자, 서진의 사도이자 저명한 서예가였던 위관의 동생입니다. 위식은 가문의 막강한 영향력에 힘입어 관직에 나아가 산기상시에 이르렀고 개양향(정)후에 봉해졌으며, 홍농태수를 지내기도 했습니다. 위관이 치양후에 봉해졌을 때 작위 일부를 동생 위식에게 나누어 주어 개양정후에 책봉되도록 하였습니다. 딸인 위수는 훗날 서진의 중신 왕준의 계실로 혼인했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1038215","remark":"","surname":"卫","surnameTc":"衛","surnameEn":"Wei","surnameJp":"衛","surnameKr":"위","surnameOther":"","name":"寔","nameTc":"寔","nameEn":"Shi","nameJp":"寔","nameKr":"식","nameOther":"","word":"叔始","wordTc":"叔始","wordEn":"Shushi","wordJp":"叔始","wordKr":"숙시","wordOther":"","icon":"卫寔","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"245","city":"CS1028","gender":"0","rule":"35","force":"20","wise":"68","politics":"72","charm":"74","will":"57","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"10/10/10/10/12/68/10/10","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4600","battleSoulPoint":"4900","debateSoulPoint":"5300","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"1/1/1/1/1/0/2/1/2/2/1/1/2/3/2/1/0/2/2/1/0/2/2/1","attribu